6. (Currently amended) The method according to Claim 1 further comprising, prior to assessing an advertising reference code associated with the location reference code:
- determining whether the traffic message is a message of every predefined number of messages for broadcast;
- generating a traffic message having the location reference code when the traffic message is a message of every predefined number of messages for broadcast;
- wherein the determination of whether to include an advertising reference code is made only for the predefined subset of messages.

