12. (Currently amended) A computer-readable medium having executable instructions stored thereon that, when executed by a processor, perform the method of Claim 1.

13. (Currently amended) An apparatus having a processor and executable instructions stored thereon that, when executed by the processor, perform the method of Claim 1.

