- generating an advertising message having the advertising reference code using the processor;
- providing the advertising message for broadcast to navigation systems using the processor;
- wherein the advertising reference code is determined based on a real-time assessment that includes evaluating whether an advertisement is available and appropriate for the location reference code at a time of transmission.

