- generating a message having advertisements using a processor;
- serially transmitting the message for broadcast to navigation systems via the traffic channel using the processor;
- wherein each message is generated with an advertising reference code that is determined based on a real-time assessment of advertisement availability and appropriateness at the time of generation.

